<view class="page"><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在读取健康记录…</view><block wx:else><view class="eyebrow">HEALTH SPACE</view><view class="title">{{detail.child.name}}的健康空间</view><view class="sub">{{detail.child.sex}} · {{detail.child.birth}}出生</view><view class="card"><view class="card-title">填写电子问卷</view><button wx:for="{{kinds}}" wx:key="key" class="plain" bindtap="fill" data-kind="{{item.key}}">{{item.title}} →</button></view><view class="card"><view class="card-title">随访安排</view><view wx:if="{{!detail.tasks.length}}" class="small">暂无随访安排</view><view wx:for="{{detail.tasks}}" wx:key="id" class="record"><view class="record-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="small">{{item.due}} · {{item.status === 'completed' ? '已完成' : '待完成'}}</view><button wx:if="{{item.status === 'pending'}}" class="secondary" bindtap="fill" data-task="{{item.id}}" data-kind="nutrition">填写随访问卷</button></view></view><view class="card"><view class="card-title">生长记录</view><view wx:for="{{detail.measurements}}" wx:key="id" class="record"><view>{{item.day}}　{{item.height}} cm / {{item.weight}} kg</view><view class="small">{{item.source}}</view></view><view class="divider"/><view class="field"><text class="label">测量日期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{measure.day}}" data-key="measure.day" bindchange="input"><view class="picker">{{measure.day}}</view></picker></view><view class="row field"><input type="digit" placeholder="身高 cm" value="{{measure.height}}" data-key="measure.height" bindinput="input"/><input type="digit" placeholder="体重 kg" value="{{measure.weight}}" data-key="measure.weight" bindinput="input"/></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="measure" disabled="{{busy}}">保存测量</button></view><view class="card"><view class="card-title">医护评估与管理计划</view><view wx:if="{{noClinical}}" class="small">暂未制定，请按医护安排随访。</view><view wx:for="{{detail.assessments}}" wx:key="id" class="record"><view class="badge">{{item.attention}}</view><view class="pre">{{item.summary}}</view></view><view wx:for="{{detail.plans}}" wx:key="id" class="record"><view class="record-title">{{item.goal}}</view><view class="pre">{{item.diet}}</view><view class="pre">{{item.guidance}}</view><view class="small">下次随访：{{item.next_date}}</view></view></view><view class="card"><view class="card-title">问卷记录</view><view wx:for="{{detail.questionnaires}}" wx:key="id" class="record"><view>{{item.kind}} · {{item.status === 'draft' ? '草稿' : '已提交'}}</view><view class="small">{{item.created}}</view></view></view><view class="card"><view class="card-title">医护沟通</view><view class="small">异步留言，非实时医疗值守；急性严重症状请及时就医。</view><view wx:for="{{detail.messages}}" wx:key="id" class="record"><view class="small">{{item.name}} · {{item.created}}</view><view class="pre">{{item.body}}</view></view><textarea placeholder="写下问题或建议" value="{{body}}" data-key="body" bindinput="input" maxlength="2000"/><button class="primary" style="margin-top:24rpx" bindtap="send" disabled="{{busy}}">发送留言</button></view><button class="plain" bindtap="back">切换孩子 / 返回列表</button></block></view>
